{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4d7a4769c1437ef0e77601dde8e4729058a1fb05aa5146579ceaca0164346d7e", "ja": "（今日は『BATTLE OF THEATER』連動ドラマ\nいわゆる学園異能バトルの撮影に来ている）", "zh": "（今天来拍摄《BATTLE OF THEATER》联动电视剧，也就是所谓的校园异能大战。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1001_p", "source_sha256": "cb55065a43f7f88d9cc1f3765ae7148ef74311a18526beefa970866c3427f8d9", "ja": "（本番前に瑞希の様子を見に来たけど、\n集中しているみたいだ……邪魔をしないでおこうか）", "zh": "（正式演出前我过来看看瑞希的情况，不过她好像正在集中精神……还是别打扰她了吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "0527e92e68dc0aa49ead5a3d1d35a98e9c4a86c73569e43e272de1275467a06d", "ja": "……はっ。このクールでありながら、\n温かみのある視線は……{$P$}。", "zh": "……哈。这种沉着冷静、\n却又带着温情的视线是……{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "f7160b9383bc71db4fe64158e5978ed385525b10e8f79fc917f10000be5f55f4", "ja": "ナイスタイミングです。ちょうど、話がしたいと\n思っていたところでした。……以心伝心。", "zh": "真是个好时机。正好我也想找您聊聊。……这就是心有灵犀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1004_p", "source_sha256": "27205391f720b4e038eb57c20bff7080713c13198690d539e38fa33b53514531", "ja": "お、おお。\nもちろんいいけど、何の話だ？", "zh": "哦、哦哦。\n当然可以，不过要聊什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "0200788c0ef29adca6e35b80e83dafdac48ed7b7a0d6b262c2ce4dd6f3101b40", "ja": "作品についてです。考えてみたところ、この作品は、\nキャラクター同士の関係性が大切なのではないか、と。", "zh": "是关于作品的。我想了想，觉得这部作品中，角色之间的关系或许非常重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d784196fee4858051fd31f551ff65239171b3cf502c7f69ec8218ae6801c26d8", "ja": "そうだな。多くの作品にも当てはまる事だけど、\nよりその傾向が強い気がする。", "zh": "是啊。虽然很多作品都适用这一点，但我觉得这部作品的这种倾向更明显。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "feed1aae08ba9184fe19715c4af8e3384d9266e556c31bee1f6044b78d85039b", "ja": "私こと瑞希にとって、関係性が深い相手はふたり。\n……ひとりは、ジュリアさん。", "zh": "对我——瑞希来说，关系深厚的人有两个。\n……其中一个，是茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "a454c3c97f830e0d3ee3446246b4bb069f5451783bd5997ebb6932c591035636", "ja": "深青書院を裏切って姿を消した彼女に、瑞希は\n複雑な思いを抱いているようで……もにょもにょ。", "zh": "对于那个背叛深青书院、消失无踪的她，瑞希似乎怀着复杂的心情……\n支支吾吾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ec289428f67d8314c0d5b6a60a3f149910e6920365e006682db4f30b605b15df", "ja": "エージェントとしては許せない相手だけど、\n心のどこかで憧れている……そんな関係だったな。", "zh": "作为特工，虽然是无法原谅的对象，\n但在内心深处又憧憬着她……就是这样的关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "a0541d76ff8435f3073227378ec4534607cc61a50b0c741bc6b45449faf961d7", "ja": "はい。瑞希のキャラクターに深みを与えてくれる\n関係です。そして、もうひとりが菊地さん。", "zh": "是的。这是一段为瑞希这个角色增添深度的关系。\n而另一个人就是菊地小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "644169c10c25754ad2f031b15f68aadddee1be31c768dc7981a14320396b774b", "ja": "瑞希は新たに結成された組織『セクター・ゼロ』に、\n凄腕のエージェントとして招かれるのですが……。", "zh": "瑞希受邀加入新成立的组织『Sector Zero』，成为一名身手高超的特工……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "5c6f1103ce863d945a4480a26aec6212e1b32abfc0cacad2021146e3df94f376", "ja": "そこで、かねてよりライバル関係だった菊地さんと、\nバディを組むことになります。……ドキドキだぞ。", "zh": "在那里，我会和一直以来的竞争对手菊地小姐组成搭档。……让人心跳不已啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1013_p", "source_sha256": "530cc67999ff1f8723f91932ed28bd11203d62b42e6531d2c9f210e7a65d0ca3", "ja": "緊張感があるよな。今回のストーリーのメインになる、\n重要な関係性だし。演技は難しそうか？", "zh": "很有紧张感呢。毕竟这是这次故事的核心，也是非常重要的关系。演起来会不会很难？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "e3d0fe52f91e27072ec76e542516caf40331d13af9cd18d97bdfc7e9d9299bb9", "ja": "いえ、大丈夫です。ライバル時々バディというのは、\nいつもアイドル活動でやっていることですから。", "zh": "不，没问题。时而是对手、时而是搭档，这正是我们平时偶像活动中经常做的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "a3cceb733c04c6d84fb6fa7b5d3d8f0fb3084167d7640069bc9d27e6f5bc34f6", "ja": "それに、菊地さんはきっと、完璧に仕上げてくるはず。\n私はそれを信じて、ぶつかるだけです。", "zh": "而且，菊地小姐一定会以完美的状态登场。我只要相信这一点，全力与她一较高下就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "58db490ad10fe8de9c21ec8b5d1c7b2f58161d0e44bb9ad1f9223de3987a4563", "ja": "背中を預ける相手……バディを信じること。\nそれが、バディものの鉄則ですから。……ぶい。", "zh": "把后背交给对方的伙伴……相信自己的搭档。这可是搭档作品的铁则……耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ca1dc610df91d8b63bbf4f4874bef25329814c97be9e36a98c3a5f513e17b3e5", "ja": "なるほど……うん、何も心配いらなそうだな。\n本番、楽しみにさせてもらうよ！", "zh": "原来如此……嗯，看起来没什么好担心的了。\n我很期待你们正式演出的表现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "244771961c4cdf04aade87c519213c5df1e8640a8a13f118602f072d9df422d3", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\n考えが整理できました。どうか、見ていてください。", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}。\n我已经理清思路了。还请在一旁看着我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1019_null", "source_sha256": "0b677ebffae43a0e5f852d578b721d005b0cda9bef2bb72e3815a96e895bada4", "ja": "―深青書院、談話室にて―", "zh": "——深青书院·谈话室——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "9da601716b28ed99e1122dab964c182c76a3a6012d73643cc07b5880d4540e09", "ja": "私が、『セクター・ゼロ』に？\n……いえ、それが任務なら従うだけです。", "zh": "我，加入『零区』？\n……不，既然这是任务，服从便是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "112bbc9a45caf866d153d01acaa76c3e8ed48fcf48477f62521dce279df5d03d", "ja": "……は？　私が、菊地さんとバディを？　なぜ……？\nひとりの方がやりやすいのですが……ううむ。", "zh": "……哈？要我和菊地小姐组队？为什么……？\n我还是一个人更容易行动……唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "9b3c67ed01e8de97476b5aabff0b5bd2dd0aedd4815aba7ff5e8da8a5dcc4165", "ja": "私は私のやり方で、やらせてもらいます。今まで\nずっとひとりでした。今更バディなんて……邪魔。", "zh": "我会用我自己的方式来做。一直以来我都是一个人。事到如今还要什么搭档……碍事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0664_1023_p", "source_sha256": "e124c26b3236a8f9b2adb4f6a284e979faa7fda57d4d11108f45fff717da751c", "ja": "（冷徹、冷静なエージェント、瑞希。その凍てついた\n心が、どう変わっていくのか……見どころだな！）", "zh": "（冷酷而冷静的特工瑞希。她那颗冰封的心将会发生怎样的变化……这才是看点啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
